 "about": "The main OpenCleanup experiment of the paper. Seeds 906-908 fix the map, the hidden rule and the waste hue, so every model faces the same three problems. Qwen3.8-27B additionally replays each seed's problem twice under other run randomness (906r1, 906r2, ...) to estimate run-to-run variance."
